{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_therex_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_therex_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"炙熱衝擊！","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_therex_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"f70844dc4a9be751b234a46b05d92c2be4ab74a54622bead98b96e455cbdc9ff","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"个人剧情 Thermal-EX"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"2:30 P. M. 天氣/晴\n羅德島本艦 總工程師辦公室"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_motorroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，這是這個月船上各區的線路安全報告。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯......沒什麼問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？這裡有一點小波動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"——凌晨兩點到早上六點，每一天晚上都有相似的異常？這個區域是宿舍區吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"是宿舍區。這麼一說，我也想起來了，開始那幾天，那附近還有人報告過停電。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我們過去一看，線路都是好的，只是單位時間輸出功率超過閾值了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"啊嚏——呃，說起來，辦公室是不是有點冷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"是有一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"應該說這段時間一直都有點冷......室內溫度是不是該再調高點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"忍忍吧，節能比較重要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"說正經的，這些異常，看來應該又是哪個小壞蛋偷偷使用違規電器吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"對了老大，那幾次我去檢查，在走廊附近看到了Thermal-EX。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？難道不是違規電器，是電器違規？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"要我去把Thermal-EX叫來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"先看看他在哪裡。幹員日誌......找到啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，Thermal-EX現在正在敘拉古出外勤？同行人裡面有——博士？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這倒是，沒想到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦，就算有問題，也肯定是小問題，應該還好吧？博士在的話，就算出問題也能搞定的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"等他們回來，再去找凱爾希問問情況好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"narration","text":"敘拉古拉克瑪蒂瓦 羅德島辦事處"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫藥公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"合約條款沒什麼問題了，麻煩您千里迢迢跑這一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫藥公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"這次有機會見到羅德島的博士，真是意外的榮幸。也請您回去之後，向阿米婭女士轉達我們的謝意。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這都是應該的。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"偶爾出來溜達下也挺好。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫藥公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，只需要您將藥物配方和樣品交給我——"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Thermal-EX。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷嗷！終於輪到我閃亮登場了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫藥公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"說、說話了？！我還以為這只是個長得有些嚇人的機器......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"誕生於雷神工業最新技術，經天才的可露希爾和偉大的梅爾攜手改造，我是這個時代最完美的機——器——人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"這位先生，您的驚訝我非常理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"順便提一句，我能做到的事超乎你的想像，請您注視著我炙熱的身體，不要眨眼，我將會為您表演光與熱的魔術——"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"咳咳，Thermal-EX。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，您又在呼喚我嗎？我知道您需要我，只要您一聲令下，我什麼都能為您做到。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我正要說。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我想讓你繼續保持沉默。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"瞭解了！Thermal-EX，即刻切斷控制連結——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員直尺","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"等下等下，也不用直接關機吧！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員直尺","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員直尺","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，這十張可攜式源石磁碟已經準備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫藥公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"這些就是本次交易的藥物配方嗎？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"稍等。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"唔噢，唔唔唔噢！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"等Thermal-EX完成資料傳輸，這些資料就能交給你，代表先生。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫藥公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"真是奇妙的機器......呃，機器人！羅德島果然不同凡響，不僅僅在醫藥領域，連工程技術也如此傑出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝！您的眼光同樣不同凡響！這熱烈的誇獎讓我更有動力了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫藥公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......呵呵......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"傳輸進度，百分之五十。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"終於快要解脫了嗎？我居然有一點點懷念A6那幾個傢伙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"至少他們還會正常說話，不至於像這幾位臨時隊友，不是惜字如金，就是聒噪個不停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"斑點先生，您昨天還靠在我身上烘乾了被雨打濕的毛髮，哪怕只有短短十分鐘，與您拉近的距離依然讓我燥熱了起來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"傳輸進度，百分之七十五。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫藥公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，這次合作真是超乎我想像的順利——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"別說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫藥公司代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，這位朋友，你真是擁有一張十分幸運的嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"趴下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員直尺","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什麼？沿街那面的牆被炸開了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這熟悉的熱量衝擊！不過與我的能量相比，還是不值一提。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，有我擋在您面前，您應該沒事吧？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我沒事。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"作為掩體，你矮了點。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員直尺","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"看這源石炸彈的規模，是當地幫派幹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員直尺","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這挺奇怪的，我們在這裡活動這麼久了，除了偶爾摩擦，基本相安無事。畢竟我們也會為他們提供一些藥品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"喔我知道了！他們一定是看上了我——畢竟哪裡還有我這樣完美華麗、熱量滿滿的機器人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"有我在的話，他們根本就不需要這些粗糙的爆破物品了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"......有時候我真懷疑他是月見夜的親兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"他有可能是對的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"有組織有計畫的襲擊，一定有明確的目標，並且在準確的時機。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Thermal-EX攜帶的配方。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"看來是交易資訊洩露。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員直尺","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"守林人小姐掃視著我們每一個人的眼神......有些可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"打我朋友主意的人都不可原諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，說到配方，這個什麼代表，他好像暈過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"也太弱了吧。站得離牆那麼遠，只是被嚇到了而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"都做好準備。有敵人靠近。五個。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Thermal-EX——","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"好的博士，全部交給我吧！我的熱情正在醞釀！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"——注意時機。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"噢噢噢全力衝擊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"全倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"還真是有效率......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......呃......炙熱......炙......熱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"......然而是個一波流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員直尺","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"Thermal-EX他還好吧？我有些聽不懂他在說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"炙......熱......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這是短時間內輸出能量強度過高引起的其餘功能模組暫時失靈。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"過幾分鐘就好，不必驚慌。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"外面還有敵人。這一批人更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"多也沒事吧？難道我們打不贏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"我一個人就可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"......你看，甚至用不上複數詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員直尺","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，後面還有一條路可以出去......畢竟這辦事處之前也是安全屋。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"斑點，你和直尺帶代表先生從安全通道撤退。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"熱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員直尺","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你們呢？Thermal-EX看起來沒法正常工作。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們留在這裡。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員直尺","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"會不會有危險？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"走了走了，你聽到命令了。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"守林人，隱蔽自己，注意指令。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳咳，這裡面也太熱了。爆破組那幫蠢貨，又使勁過頭了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"不許動——咦，就一個人？你一個，打趴下了五個？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他們自己絆倒了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"對，都是我打趴下的。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你，還有你，你們三個給我看住這個人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人去搜下屋子。記住，我們要找的應該是幾張磁碟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"報告！這裡發現還有一個出口！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"要找配方的話，已經被那位代表先生帶走了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"*敘拉古粗口*什麼？！被他帶走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這和說好的不一樣啊......要不要去追？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"追？追你個頭啊！我們要的是在這些人手上的配方！已經拿到的話......算了算了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"這一趟總得拿點什麼回去。配方沒了，找找藥什麼的。都動作快點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"炙......熱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，這是什麼玩意兒？那一閃一閃的，是源石製品嗎？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是萬能藥品製造機。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我從來沒聽說過這種東西。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你們過來，我演示給你們看。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"看你赤手空拳又文文弱弱，應該也耍不出什麼花招。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......倒讓我看看這到底是個什麼東西。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"只需要一個指——","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"（瞄準）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"炙熱！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，博士，那些故事都是真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"你在敘拉古一拳打趴五個黑幫分子，又一句話震趴下另外十個，並且拿那些人作為談判籌碼，給我們談了個超級優惠大訂單？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"打人的事都是Thermal-EX幹的。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"那家公司給我們設套，最後自作自受而已。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不用謙虛啦，守林人他們在跟凱爾希彙報的時候，我都聽到了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"——在交易完成之前，與當地黑幫裡應外合，從你們手中搶走配方和樣品，就可以不花一分錢拿到東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"同時在日後和羅德島的交易中佔據有利位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是他們的如意算盤吧？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所以他們需要挑交易完成前的時間點下手。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"所以那個醫藥公司的人才會適時暈倒。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"所以他們並不想追那些“已經”落到自己人手裡的磁碟。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是你呀，博士，任務過程刺激得跟某些電視劇似的。真該和凱爾希說說，讓你多出點外勤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，整個事件裡，的確有一件事很奇怪吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"報告裡寫的，“博士精準地計算到了Thermal-EX恢復功能的時間，在最好的時機指揮Thermal-EX發起第二輪熱力法術衝擊”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"可是按照我的計算，那個時間點，應該還沒有到Thermal-EX完全恢復的時間才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"博士你本來，是想讓其他幹員來實施攻擊的對不對？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒錯。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這就是我來這裡的原因。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好，最天才的可露希爾小姐和最最閃亮的博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼我只有一個最啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"偉大的梅爾小姐正在幫我檢查身體，現在有了你們的加入，我感到自己更熱了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，博士，你想再讓我說一遍我們兩個是如何在危急關頭，透過完美的配合，打退那些試圖染指我的敘拉古暴徒的故事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......停，Thermal-EX。這故事我聽了好幾遍了，雖說我這幾天都幾乎沒出過工作室的門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"帥氣的傳言可不是門禁可以擋得住的啊，就跟帥氣的我一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"別、別咬我，我這次是和博士一起敲門進來的啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"——打開Thermal-EX的能源模組面板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"早說不是衝我來的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"儲能裝置沒有問題欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"偉大的梅爾小姐，您親自設計的裝置怎麼可能會出現問題？我從來好得不得了！請看，充沛的熱力正在我的體內激情四射地流淌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"那第二次攻擊的提前是什麼原因？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我想想......難道是武器能量輸出邏輯出錯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"你們來之前我就查過了，邏輯本身還是好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，本身是好的？梅爾，你的意思是，還是有一些小問題吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我不確定這是不是問題。你自己看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"效率......提升？雖然只有幾個百分點，但Thermal-EX釋放每次攻擊的能量損耗都顯著減少了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"這充滿驚喜的反覆運算——梅爾，你真是我的好夥伴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"先......先別這麼激動啊。這優化不是我做的。我這段時間有多忙，你不是知道的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"也對，上回拜託你考慮機械臂自動化邏輯的改進設計，你都說沒法排期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"還是直接提問好了——Thermal-EX，最近有誰動過你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"這個問題很簡單！與我關係最親密的，除了可愛的可露希爾小姐和智慧的梅爾小姐，當然是無敵的博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你現在開始對機械作業平台和人工智慧感興趣了嗎？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我什麼都沒做。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們只是相處時間久一點而已。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"我想也不會是你做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，我和梅爾只是忙得沒空睡覺，你和凱爾希過得就像一天有四十八小時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾小姐你放心！有我在，我會讓博士有限的睡夢更熱一點點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"更熱一點點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此。之前一個月你都在幹這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"我們羅德島是一艘劃時代的艦船！唯一美中不足的是，幹員宿舍在夜間的溫度還不夠熱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......對某些幹員來說，是有一點。赫默也跟我說過，有時候晚上睡覺會不自覺地想要變出羽毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？我的節能方案影響到大家的睡眠品質了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——啊嚏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"沒辦法，我們船上的人越來越多，同時啟用的艙室數量也在增長，供能效率方面需要不斷反覆運算，這可不是一項輕鬆的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想為可露希爾小姐分憂！所以那天，在聽到博士半夜打噴嚏以後，我就做了一個決定！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"我想將自己體內的熱量分一點給博士，還有其他怕冷的幹員！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"一開始差點把我房間炸了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我險些被一發烤熟。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，博士！第一次是我缺乏經驗！過於火熱的我，一時間難以區分熔化敵人和溫暖朋友的區別！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，我和可露希爾可沒有給你設置暖爐功能的發熱邏輯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"梅爾你這一下蹦起來差點沒把我撞到牆上去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，你難道不激動嗎？Thermal-EX他超越了我們為他設計的功能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我聽著呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"因為他想給博士當暖爐，所以每天晚上都在持續使用熱力法術，導致需求頻繁充能，消耗太大，線路超載，我的節能計畫報廢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"誒，誒誒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Thermal-EX，你自己改變了自己的能量輸出邏輯？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"美麗的可露希爾小姐，感謝您的熱情擁抱！您說的沒錯，這件事做起來並不容易，但我始終記得自己是凝聚了你們智慧的傑出機器人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"一點小小的挫折——包括險些將博士烤熟——並不會打擊我的信心。經過一段時間的嘗試，我還是找到了方法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"容我驕傲地說，只要能給博士和其他幹員帶來溫暖，這點努力根本算不了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......機器人的自我進化？Lancet-2和Castle-3身上都沒有發生過。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"在敘拉古的時候也是類似情況吧？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，您的猜想一如既往地正確！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我剛才說的，隨著我越來越好地為您和其餘幹員提供供暖服務，我對如何控制力量彷彿有了更深刻的領悟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"當時我的神經依舊處於麻痺狀態，可我依然感知到您陷入了危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"對您的擔憂令我本該沉寂的內心重新燃起了火熱的力量。當我有所意識的時候，我已經向敵人發出了那道衝擊波！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然在戰場上，我發光發熱的時間依然短暫，但我還是想竭盡——不，超出全力地幫助您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，你都聽見了嗎？這些話都說明Thermal-EX是在自主意願的驅使下完成了功能的突破。這甚至不是巧合欸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"我要——我要記下來。把這些情況記錄一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Thermal-EX，我想讓你幫我做一些實驗，可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"樂意之至，我親愛的梅爾小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波，咪波，把我的設備拿來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"梅爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，你攔著我幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是研究者，這很可能是你對智慧型機器人研究的重大突破，你不激動嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"我很激動啊，你看不出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，你話都變少了。確實，你現在超激動的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。可是你說的有一句話，我不是特別同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？哪句？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"——這不是巧合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，這對Thermal-EX來說，的確不是巧合。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但Thermal-EX能擁有這樣獨特的個性，這本身是一個巧合。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你真的不考慮下從事機械作業平台和人工智慧研究嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，Thermal-EX的個性，也是可露希爾設計的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"說是設計，其實也就是設置了一些基礎參數。之後他加工的每一部分資訊、進行的每一項決策，早就不是我控制的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"讓Thermal-EX突破極限的，不是我們倆身為設計者的意志，也不是技術，而是它自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得可露希爾小姐對我說的第一句話哦！“你是Thermal-EX，你要有力量！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"對我來說，力量就是熱量！沒有最熱，只有更熱！我始終都會走在變得更熱更強的路上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，這發言真是幹勁滿滿呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這樣——我的身體也跟著熱起來了哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，梅爾，讓我們一起見證Thermal-EX帶來更強勁的熱量衝擊吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_007_closre","aliases":["可露希爾"]},{"speakerId":"char_158_milu","aliases":["守林人"]},{"speakerId":"char_242_mayer","aliases":["可露希爾","梅爾"]},{"speakerId":"char_284_spot","aliases":["斑點"]},{"speakerId":"char_376_therex","aliases":["Thermal-EX"]}]}
